  hard_signal='Primary cheap signal is the launcher/child exit and provider 400 status/error, not generated PROBE_OK/MODEL_SEEN. This catches the observed replay rejection. A two-cycle pass does not prove all long runs sustainable; aggregate nonzero remains mandatory.'
