  adoption_cost=[ordered]@{files_touched='Immediate guard: the two round stage-b launch scripts; reuse an existing owner declaration if immutable, otherwise one owner-approved manifest field/record. An optional shared guard helper adds one file only if other launchers will reuse it. All are outside this research write set and require their owner to implement.';owner='Lane-harness/orchestration maintainer owns admission/status handling; owner of WorkOrder/round declaration authorizes any model or effort substitution. Relay/operator owns strict-route resolution and thinking-history adapter investigation.';credentials='Immediate guard uses existing lane credentials; no new human credential or new service. Preflight adds two short tool roundtrips per lane configuration plus bounded startup latency/token cost. If existing credentials cannot run the declared route, halt for owner action; do not acquire substitutes.';strict_route_cost='Potential additional relay handler/config and harness integration; exact source paths are absent from the evidence. Owner decision required if the relay lacks strict resolution/receipt support. No new service should be required if existing relay can be changed; cannot promise that without its source.'}
